{
  "info": {
    "name": "NutriBase API",
    "description": "Complete NutriBase REST API collection covering Auth, Users, Patients, and Visits.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection\n2. Run **Login as Admin** first — the test script auto-sets `admin_token`\n3. Run **Login as Doctor** — auto-sets `doctor_token`\n4. Run **Login as Patient (Marko)** — auto-sets `patient_token`\n\n## Seeded demo accounts\n| Role | Email | Password |\n|---|---|---|\n| Admin | hajrovica@gmail.com | Test12345 |\n| Doctor | doctor@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Marko Petrović | marko.petrovic@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Fatima Hadžić | fatima.hadzic@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Stefan Jovanović | stefan.jovanovic@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Lejla Kovačev | lejla.kovacev@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Nermin Bašić | nermin.basic@nutribase.test | password |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "doctor_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "patient_token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', json.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('admin_token saved');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"hajrovica@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test12345\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as Doctor",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('doctor_token', json.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('doctor_token saved');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"doctor@nutribase.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as Patient — Marko",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
